  <!-- 11 PSR CASE STUDIES (Parent Menu 7) -->
  <section class="section-wrap" id="case-studies">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <div>
          <div class="section-heading-sm">Verified Operational Snapshots</div>
          <h2 class="section-heading-lg">11 Case Studies & Performance Benchmarks</h2>
          <p class="section-summary">
            Real-world aerospace deployments across the United States and Canada documented under the Problem-Solution-Result (PSR) framework.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-nav-tabs">
        <button class="case-tab-btn active" onclick="filterCaseStudies('all')">All Deployments (11)</button>
        <button class="case-tab-btn" onclick="filterCaseStudies('us')">United States (8)</button>
        <button class="case-tab-btn" onclick="filterCaseStudies('ca')">Canada (3)</button>
        <button class="case-tab-btn" onclick="filterCaseStudies('workforce')">Workforce Safety</button>
        <button class="case-tab-btn" onclick="filterCaseStudies('asset')">Asset & GSE</button>
        <button class="case-tab-btn" onclick="filterCaseStudies('trace')">Digital Thread</button>
      </div>

      <div class="module-grid-3" id="caseStudiesContainer">
        <!-- 1. California -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="asset">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Sunnyvale, California | SIF High-Bay Logistics</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">High-Bay Assembly Facility Logistics</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Frequent production delays occurred due to misaligned staging of sub-assemblies and GSE within high-bay integration facilities.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We deployed UWB-based tracking nodes and mapped internal logistical workflows to automate status logging as assemblies transitioned stations.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Payload integration throughput increased by 30%, eliminating manual search delays.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Automated tracking of GSE is just as critical to the critical path as the flight payload itself.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Florida -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="asset">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Melbourne, Florida | GSE Control</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">Ground Support & Tooling Diagnostics</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Intermittent tool misplacement in legacy assembly tooling caused holds during tight delivery windows.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We retrofitted legacy tool systems with industrial-grade telemetry units and real-time AI threshold dashboards.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Tool search times were reduced by 85%, and annual asset shrinkage was eliminated entirely.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Real-time diagnostics of ground-side hardware are vital for mitigating operational risk.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Colorado -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="trace">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Denver, Colorado | Cleanroom Traceability</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">Optic-Sensor Cleanroom Traceability</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Research-focused team struggled to prove continuous contamination compliance during optic-sensor assembly.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We deployed our environmental traceability system, correlating technician badge entry with live particulate counts.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Post-assembly contamination incidents eliminated; audit preparation time reduced by 70%.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Correlating environmental data with hardware provenance is mandatory for high-fidelity control.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Alabama -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="asset">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Huntsville, Alabama | Supply Chain</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">Defense Component Supply Chain Optimization</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Supply bottlenecks occurred from delayed shipments of radiation-hardened parts from overseas partners.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We installed telemetry gateways at partner docks linked to AI demand models to predict delays dynamically.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Production stall-time due to material shortages decreased by 45%.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Visibility into the Tier-2 supplier network is essential for high-velocity aerospace integration.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Texas -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="asset">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Houston, Texas | Tooling Lifecycle</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">Lift-and-Rotate GSE Calibration Intelligence</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Lack of calibration visibility on specialized lift GSE risked using expired tools on multi-million dollar stages.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We implemented RFID-based lifecycle intelligence with automated calibration gatekeeping at tool checkout.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Tool calibration audit findings reduced to zero; GSE maintenance efficiency improved by 35%.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Automated gatekeeping is the only reliable way to manage compliance in high-volume environments.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Washington -->
        <div class="case-study-box" data-country="us" data-tag="trace">
          <div>
            <div class="case-location-tag">Seattle, Washington | Digital Thread</div>
            <h4 class="case-study-title">Airframe Structural Fastener Genealogy</h4>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Manual documentation of thousands of airframe structural fasteners was error-prone and labor-intensive.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We deployed digital thread software capturing technician ID, smart tool calibration, and torque verification per fastener.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Fastener non-conformance reports eliminated; build dossier compilation time cut by 80%.</div>
            <div class="psr-lesson-text">Lesson: Digital capture of torque data during installation is the best way to ensure structural integrity.</div>
