            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Problem:</strong> Risk of personnel inadvertently entering high-voltage radio-frequency test chambers while active.</div>
            <div class="psr-item"><strong>Solution:</strong> We integrated UWB geofencing with the chamber interlock system to trigger automatic alarms and shutdowns upon proximity.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="psr-result-badge">Result: Personnel hazard exposures completely eliminated; facility achieved 100% safety compliance.</div>
